window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A broken, twisted girl, her fairytale in ashes.</p> <p>Three players in the game, their pawn in a gilded cage.</p> <p>I didn't know why they had brought me back or what they wanted from me. They should have let me die in that room of pain and shame, but instead they've hidden me away, kept me under the attentive eyes of dangerous men unaccustomed to the likes of me in their midst.</p> <p>I was sure my useless bodyguard and father-in-law never expected me to become attached to the ambitious, damaged, and unhinged men they stashed me with, but I was no longer concerned with what they thought of me.</p> <p>Free of the monster I'd married, I planned to live my life on my terms… until it was made clear I was expected to honor my obligations or face the consequences. No matter which way I chose, my life wasn't my own. I wasn't sure it ever had been, or if it ever would be.</p> <p><i>The Redemption of Shelby Ann</i> is the second installment in the Twisted Love series performed in DUET style narration, and is a dark, contemporary reverse harem. This series will have an eventual HEA, but it's going to take some patience to get there. </p> <p>Mature/18+ audiences only—dark content that isn't for anyone with listening restrictions.</p>"; 
